sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IF as IF
    participant ID as ID
    participant EX as EX
    participant MEM as MEM
    participant WB as WB commit controller
    participant CSR as csr_regfile
    participant PC as IF PC mux
    participant HZ as hazard_unit

    Note over ID,WB: MRET is a normal instruction until WB commit

    ID->>EX: is_mret propagates through pipeline
    EX->>MEM: is_mret_M preserved
    MEM->>WB: is_mret_W preserved

    WB->>WB: mret_commit = valid_W & is_mret_W & ~exc_valid_W
    WB->>CSR: csr_write_en_mret = 1
    WB->>CSR: csr_waddr_mret = 12'h300
    WB->>CSR: csr_wdata_mret = new_mstatus
    WB->>PC: wb_trap_redirect = 1, trap_target = mepc.BASE
    WB->>HZ: flush_pipeline_onehot = 4'b1111

    CSR->>CSR: mstatus.MIE <- mstatus.MPIE
    CSR->>CSR: mstatus.MPIE <- 1
    CSR->>CSR: mstatus.MPP <- 11
    PC->>IF: redirect fetch to mepc
    WB-->>IF: pipeline drained, execution resumes after return
